Z||000000||MikeSchaefer||05-19-2001||04:00 PM||||Hi, the El Paso, IL Fiero Show for this summer will be held on Saturday, August 11th (11- at the South Pointe Park here in El Paso.  Last year we had around 40 cars show up throughout the day, even though it rained.  It is an informal get together, and there will be a large turn out this year.  NIFE members, Gateway Fieros, Michigan Fieros and all other clubs in the area are invited and many have e-mailed me to tell of their interest, Bob Steiger will be there with a few cars, Archie said he'd probably be there, Dave Bagwell is bringing the Predator kit, and Bob Rebec will be there in his newly finished northstar Fiero.  For all the details you can print off this page as a flyer: <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/MotorCity/1930/elpasoshow.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/MotorCity/1930/elpasoshow.html</A> <BR>Hope to see you here,<BR>Mike Schaefer <A HREF="http://surf.to/fiero" TARGET=_blank>http://surf.to/fiero</A> <p>[This message has been edited by MikeSchaefer (edited 05-19-2001).]||||reg||6
