Z||000003||MikeSchaefer||07-05-2001||01:54 PM||||Just a reminder about the show, it's coming up quickly now.  The Pantagraph Newspaper did a story on Fieros and my show and I've had a lot of people contacting me about it, so I imagine a lot of the general public will be checking out the cars this year too.  Hope to see everyone there!||||reg||6
