Z||000011||MikeSchaefer||08-02-2001||06:07 PM||||Can't wait to see everyone here, it should be pretty big this year, I have a mailbox full of people planning on coming and the Gateway (St Louis) Fieros just e-mailed me saying they are bringing about 6 cars up including a race-Fiero that will be trailered. Rodney Dickman just informed me that he will probably be stopping by with a few new products also, which is great news.<BR>---Knight Rider:<BR>I do know of a few Fieros that will be for sale at the show, including a damaged a 88 Formula with about 25,000 miles on it and in mint condition except for a wrecked passenger side wheel area. This car should go for a very good price, but will have to be trailered home. There will be a few other cars for sale at the show too.<P>Later,<BR>Michael Schaefer <A HREF="http://surf.to/fiero" TARGET=_blank>http://surf.to/fiero</A> <P><BR><p>[This message has been edited by MikeSchaefer (edited 08-03-2001).]||||reg||6
